text = "First of all, Luna is a very cold planet where it always snows. You'll also have a tough time understanding the Eucar Tribe that lives in Luna when you talk to them at first. If there's anything you're worried about, you should meet Elliot, one of the ambassadors for the Akram Kingdom."
